{"4805180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tech Resale Simulator", "steam_appid": 4805180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4825860], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Second-Hand Electronics Empire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small store and grow it into the city's most successful second-hand electronics shop. Buy mystery boxes, uncover valuable items, stock your shelves, and attract customers looking for their next great find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crate is a gamble. Will you discover hidden treasures or end up with a pile of junk?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unboxing &amp; Shelving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase mystery boxes packed with random second-hand electronics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From everyday gadgets to rare collectibles, every box contains surprises. The better your store becomes, the more valuable boxes you'll unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/a6d2159f54119d2511cd806b7f4cf4d1.poster.avif?t=1782730902\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/a6d2159f54119d2511cd806b7f4cf4d1.webm?t=1782730902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/a6d2159f54119d2511cd806b7f4cf4d1.mp4?t=1782730902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Your Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange shelves and merchandise however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a neat and professional shopping experience, or pack your store floor-to-ceiling with products. The layout is entirely up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/2adab4934c9a261db077d43034998465.poster.avif?t=1782730902\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/2adab4934c9a261db077d43034998465.webm?t=1782730902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/2adab4934c9a261db077d43034998465.mp4?t=1782730902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy Low, Sell High</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the second-hand market for bargains and profitable deals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lucky purchase could bring huge profits, but bad deals can cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/70e614e9154aaa00a72c290d1968f0ac.poster.avif?t=1782730902\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/70e614e9154aaa00a72c290d1968f0ac.webm?t=1782730902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/70e614e9154aaa00a72c290d1968f0ac.mp4?t=1782730902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ring up customers at the register using both cash and card payments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage checkout efficiently and keep your customers happy as your business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4805180/extras/be056c73b48308289cc2919c7d84b3bf.poster.avif?t=1782730902\" width=426 